 "footer": "<h3>Photo credits</h3><ul><li>Cover: “Place / Place, Japan” meme, author unknown — <a href=\"https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/thing-japan\">Know Your Meme</a>, reproduced for identification. The same template also circulates as “Thing, Japan”.</li><li>Koenji: “Koenji Street Scene (53416682176).jpg” by Stephen Kelly from San Francisco, CA, USA, CC BY 2.0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Koenji_Street_Scene_(53416682176).jpg\">source</a></li><li>Shimokitazawa: “Walk in Shimokitazawa 3.jpg” by Syced, CC0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Walk_in_Shimokitazawa_3.jpg\">source</a></li><li>Omoide Yokocho, Shinjuku: “Omoide Yokocho (53136554958).jpg” by Dick Thomas Johnson from Tokyo, Japan, CC BY 2.0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Omoide_Yokocho_(53136554958).jpg\">source</a></li><li>Amerikamura: “Amerikamura (Busy).jpg” by BradBeattie at English Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 3.0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Amerikamura_(Busy).jpg\">source</a></li><li>Shinsekai: “Shinsekai @ Osaka (13382384655).jpg” by Guilhem Vellut from Annecy, France, CC BY 2.0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shinsekai_@_Osaka_(13382384655).jpg\">source</a></li><li>Kiyamachi: “Kiyamachi Café.jpg” by Japanexperterna.se, CC BY-SA 3.0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kiyamachi_Caf%C3%A9.jpg\">source</a></li><li>Teramachi arcade: “Teramachi shopping street, Kyoto, May 2017.jpg” by Celuici, CC BY-SA 3.0 — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Teramachi_shopping_street,_Kyoto,_May_2017.jpg\">source</a></li><li>Evening, Demachiyanagi: “Evening of Demachiyanagi, Kyoto.jpg” by 桂鷺淵 (Katsura Roen), Public domain — <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Evening_of_Demachiyanagi,_Kyoto.jpg\">source</a></li></ul><p>All photographs from Wikimedia Commons under the licences listed. Venue facts were compiled in October 2026; hours and prices change.</p>"
